  "system": {
    "identifier": "jiton-magnet-release-dust-mesh",
    "description": "<p>You create an expanding mesh of dust, in the shape of a tightly knit web. Select a point you can see within range as your fill a 20-foot cube with this web like pattern, providing support and footing for allied creatures.</p>\n<p>For the duration, creatures of your choice within the affected area are immune to environmental hazards, difficult terrain and can walk across the affected area, even if it is over a deep ravine.</p>",
